             <div class="col-12 mb-3 mb-md-5 text-center">
                 <h3>Join hands with AstroKumbh – where faith meets tradition, and rituals bring transformation.</h3>
                 <hr class="short" />
             </div>
             <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
                 <p>Maa Tara Anushthan is a powerful and sacred ritual dedicated to Maa Tara, one of the ten Mahavidyas (great wisdom goddesses) in Hinduism. Maa Tara is known for her protective powers, spiritual healing, and ability to provide guidance during difficult times. She is a goddess of wisdom, knowledge, and removal of obstacles, particularly in the journey of self-realization and enlightenment.</p>
             </div>
             <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Maa Tara is also revered for her ability to overcome fear, defeat enemies, and protect her devotees from physical and spiritual harm. The Tara Anushthan is performed to invoke her divine blessings and secure her protection, guidance, and spiritual growth.</p>

             </div>
             <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
                 <b>Why Perform Maa Tara Anushthan?</b>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Seek Protection and Safety: Maa Tara is worshipped for her ability to protect her devotees from physical harm, spiritual dangers, and evil influences.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Remove Obstacles: Tara is known to clear obstacles in the path of success and progress, making it an ideal ritual for overcoming hurdles in life, career, and relationships.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Achieve Spiritual Enlightenment: Maa Tara provides spiritual wisdom and guidance, making this ritual highly beneficial for individuals on a spiritual journey.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Overcome Fear and Anxiety: Tara's blessings help remove fears, anxieties, and mental blockages, allowing her devotees to live with peace of mind and confidence.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Victory Over Enemies: Tara has the power to protect from rivals, enemies, and evil influences, ensuring that her devotees are shielded from harm.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Favorable Business & Career Growth: Maa Tara is believed to remove delays in career and business, ensuring smooth progress and success in professional ventures.</p>

             </div>
             <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
                 <b>Rituals Performed in Maa Tara Anushthan</b>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Invocation of Lord Ganesha: The ritual begins with the invocation of Lord Ganesha, the remover of obstacles, to ensure a smooth flow of the ceremony.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Establishing the Idol or Yantra of Maa Tara: The idol or Yantra (sacred geometric representation) of Maa Tara is placed on the altar, and worship begins with reverence and devotion.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Chanting of Maa Tara’s Mantras: The Tara Mantras, powerful invocations to Maa Tara, are chanted to invoke her energy and blessings. These mantras are considered to have the ability to overcome obstacles and provide spiritual insight.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Abhishek (Holy Bathing): The idol of Maa Tara is bathed with holy water, milk, honey, and other auspicious offerings to purify and energize the idol.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Offerings of Flowers and Sacred Items: Sacred offerings such as flowers, fruits, incense sticks, and bilva leaves are placed on the altar to honor Maa Tara.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Aarti and Bhajans: Devotional aarti and bhajans (songs of praise) are sung to elevate the spiritual atmosphere and invoke the goddess's blessings.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Puja for Healing and Protection: The puja is performed to request Maa Tara's protection and spiritual healing. Specific rituals may also be carried out to remove any negative energies or evil influences surrounding the individual.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Daan (Charity): A portion of the ritual includes making donations to Brahmins or those in need, a practice that helps in gaining divine blessings.</p>

             </div>
             <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
                 <b>Benefits of Maa Tara Anushthan</b>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Divine Protection: Maa Tara offers spiritual and physical protection to her devotees, shielding them from harm, evil forces, and dangerous situations.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Clear Obstacles and Delays: This anushthan is highly effective in clearing obstacles in both personal life and career, helping individuals move forward without hindrances.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Overcoming Fear and Anxiety: Maa Tara’s blessings help in overcoming fears, anxieties, and emotional blockages, promoting inner peace and courage.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Victory Over Enemies: This ritual helps in protecting you from rivals, enemies, and harmful individuals or energies that may be trying to create disturbances in your life.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Spiritual Growth and Knowledge: Maa Tara provides divine wisdom, knowledge, and enlightenment, making it a highly beneficial ritual for spiritual aspirants.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Success in Business and Career: Maa Tara helps remove delays and obstacles in business growth and career progression, ensuring smooth success.</p>
                 
             </div>
             <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
                 <b>Special Services for Maa Tara Anushthan</b>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Complete Havan and Abhishek:
A full Havan (fire ritual) and Abhishek are performed to cleanse your environment and invoke Maa Tara’s blessings for protection and success.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Mantra Chanting and Homam:
Expert priests perform Tara Mantra chanting and Homam (fire offerings) to invoke Maa Tara’s protection and clear obstacles in your path.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Spiritual Healing for Emotional Blockages:
We provide spiritual healing services to remove emotional trauma, mental blockages, and negative thought patterns, allowing you to live with peace and clarity.</p>
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Astrological Remedies for Success and Protection:
Based on your astrological chart, we offer remedies such as gemstones, mantras, and Pujas to enhance protection, success, and spiritual growth.</p>
                 
             </div>
